Changes 2022–2024:
* March 2024: John Beavis (Conservative) resigns; seat left vacant until 2024 election<ref name="lee" />
* April 2024: Maggie Morgan (Conservative) dies; seat left vacant at time of May 2024 elections, with by-election subsequently arranged for 4 July 2024.<ref>{{cite news |last1=Davey |first1=Matt |title=By-election announced in Gosport after death of councillor |url=https://www.dailyecho.co.uk/news/24356659.by-election-announced-gosport-death-councillor/ |access-date=5 July 2024 |work=Daily Echo |date=1 June 2024}}</ref>
* July 2024: Jonathan Brown (Labour) wins Grange and Alver Valley seat in July 2024 by-election<ref>{{cite news |title=Grange and Alver Valley by-election results |url=https://www.gosport.gov.uk/article/2755/Grange-and-Alver-Valley-by-election-results/ |access-date=15 August 2024 |date=6 July 2024}}</ref>

